  "sourceTitle": "Pudding Icing",
  "sourceText": "Pudding Icing\nBy: Anonymous\nPublished: Saturday, February 13, 2010 - 6:20am\n\nIngredients\n\n\n\n\n1 cup Milk\n1 pkt Instant pudding (small)\ncup Butter/margarine\ncup Shortening\n1 cup Powdered sugar\nteaspoon Vanilla\n\nPreparation\n\n1 Mix together 1 cup milk and 1 box of pudding and let stand. Mix together butter, shortening, powdered sugar and vanilla thoroughly. Add both mixtures together and blend well. Will ice 2 9-inch cakes.",
